                                                "example_id": "e7952ac7-da07-44b9-ad6c-3abd71cabaf9",
                                                "sense_id": "b53caee9-794b-3499-9d6c-d00b837dd531",
                                                "text": "Now these are the generations of the higher vertebrata, in the cosmic period that the Unknowable evoluted the bipedal mammalia […]"
